<title>USA: Emisphere starts one-million share offering.</title>
<headline>Emisphere starts one-million share offering.</headline>
<dateline>HAWTHORNE, N.Y. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Emisphere Technologies Inc said Monday it started a public one-million share offering at $19 a share for gross proceeds of about $17.4 million.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman said the shares already had been placed with institutional investors. She had not received word whether underwriter Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co's exercised its over-allotment option of 150,000 shares.</p>
</text>
